  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "じょうぶつできない　たましいがかぜに　ふかれているうち　かれくさをまきこんで　ポケモンになった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "성불하지 못한 영혼이 바람에 날리다가 마른 풀과 엉키면서 포켓몬이 되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "無法升天的靈魂在風的吹拂下被捲進枯草裡，變成了寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon est né lorsque, portée par le vent, une âme incapable de trouver le repos s’est retrouvée empêtrée dans des herbes sèches.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Weherba entstehen, wenn Seelen, die keinen Frieden finden, vom Wind fortgeweht werden und sich in verdorrtem Gras verheddern.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que este Pokémon nace cuando las almas en pena terminan enredadas en la hierba seca tras ser arrastradas por el viento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un’anima incapace di passare all’altro mondo, che trasportata via dal vento è rimasta impigliata in un arbusto secco, diventando un Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "A soul unable to move on to the afterlife was blown around by the wind until it got tangled up with dried grass and became a Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "成仏できない　魂が風に　吹かれているうち　枯草を巻き込んで　ポケモンになった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "无法升天的灵魂在风的吹拂下被卷进枯草里，变成了宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que este Pokémon nace cuando las almas en pena terminan enredadas en la hierba seca tras ser arrastradas por el viento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かぜにふかれて　こうやを　ころがりゆきさきは　じぶんでも　わからない。からだが　ぬれるのが　だいきらい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "바람에 날려 황야를 구르며 어디로 가는지는 자신도 모른다. 몸이 젖는 것을 매우 싫어한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在風的吹拂下滾動於荒野間，就連自己也不知道會滾到哪裡去。最討厭身體被弄得濕答答的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon roule à travers les plaines arides, porté par le vent, sans savoir lui-même où cela va le mener. Il déteste être mouillé.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vom Wind getrieben rollt dieses Pokémon durch die Ödnis, ohne zu wissen, wohin die Reise geht. Es verabscheut es, nass zu werden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Rueda por los páramos a merced del viento, sin que él mismo sepa dónde recalará. No soporta mojarse.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Spinto dal vento, rotola per distese brulle senza sapere dove andrà a finire. Detesta bagnarsi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Not even Bramblin knows where it is headed as it tumbles across the wilderness, blown by the wind. It loathes getting wet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "風に吹かれて　荒野を　転がり行き先は　自分でも　わからない。体が　濡れるのが　大嫌い。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "随着风在荒野之间滚动，自己也不知道会滚到哪里去。最讨厌身体被弄得湿答答的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
